{
  "name": "#05-NonStream-Cloud-v1.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "tigerai-query-cloud",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wh",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -560,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "tigerai-query-cloud"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "p-chat",
              "name": "chatInput",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.chatInput || $json.body.question || $json.body.query }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-app",
              "name": "app_name",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.app_name || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-coll",
              "name": "collection_name",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.collection_name || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-sess",
              "name": "sessionId",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.sessionId || $json.body.session_id || 'default' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-mink",
              "name": "min_keywords",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.min_keywords || 1 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-prov",
              "name": "provider",
              "value": "cloud",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "prep",
      "name": "Prep Core Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -360,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "0UQpFS2dW2As1JGL",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "core",
      "name": "Execute RAG Core",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -150,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c-r",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.route }}",
              "rightValue": "rag",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "route",
      "name": "RAG or Direct?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        60,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "WePsMURN28E7ECrI",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sub",
      "name": "Execute Sub-Chat-Cloud",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        280,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// RAG 回應整形（Sub-Chat 回來後仍帶 core 的 sources/hits/keywords）\nreturn [{ json: { output: $json.output || '', mode: 'rag', sources: $json.sources || [], hits: $json.hits || 0, keywords_used: $json.keywords_used || [], sessionId: $json.sessionId } }];"
      },
      "id": "shrag",
      "name": "Shape RAG Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        500,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Direct 模式：core 內 Agent1 已產生完整答案\nreturn [{ json: { output: $json.answer || '', mode: 'direct', sources: [], hits: 0, keywords_used: [], sessionId: $json.sessionId } }];"
      },
      "id": "shdir",
      "name": "Shape Direct Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        280,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "resp",
      "name": "Respond to Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        720,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# #05-NonStream-Cloud-v1.0 (2026-05-25)\n\n非串流查詢入口(雲端)。薄入口:Execute #05-RAG-Core 取檢索結果 → Sub-Chat-Cloud 回答。\n\n**Webhook:** POST /webhook/tigerai-query-cloud\n**provider:** cloud(寫死;傳給 core 決定 embed/回答模型)\n**核心:** #05-RAG-Core-v1.0 (0UQpFS2dW2As1JGL)\n\n## 版本歷史\n- v1.0 (2026-05-25): 由 #05-Query-v1.10 拆出(共用檢索核心 + 4 薄入口架構)。多 app 共用此入口,靠 app_name 區分 collection。",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -160
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
